        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "46a5ddf9-2f6c-313a-ab0c-21fd100cbfb7",
                "word": "intelligiblement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f9b409ab-e19f-3aaa-9f3c-575354e291cb",
                        "entry_id": "46a5ddf9-2f6c-313a-ab0c-21fd100cbfb7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une manière facile à comprendre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c7e00ef-b891-4944-af18-7ad30ec209b5",
                                "sense_id": "f9b409ab-e19f-3aaa-9f3c-575354e291cb",
                                "text": "Lesquels, non contents de savoir tout ce qui est intelligiblement expliqué dans leur auteur, veulent outre cela y trouver la solution de plusieurs difficultés dont il ne dit rien et auxquelles il n'a peut-être jamais pensé."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7aeb426f-e724-437d-9bf2-f8778b09af6d",
                                "sense_id": "f9b409ab-e19f-3aaa-9f3c-575354e291cb",
                                "text": "Il parlait français fort intelligiblement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "03029d69-3ae1-4aa6-8c7e-0861c67a722b",
                                "sense_id": "f9b409ab-e19f-3aaa-9f3c-575354e291cb",
                                "text": "Il a prononcé intelligiblement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35a4cc7f-b4cc-48ad-9704-f3a8cce976d2",
                                "sense_id": "f9b409ab-e19f-3aaa-9f3c-575354e291cb",
                                "text": "La présence de Dieu se rendait sensible par les oracles qui sortaient intelligiblement du milieu de l’arche entre les deux chérubins."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a1bb9bc-4187-3e66-a23b-14224bcdeffe",
                        "entry_id": "46a5ddf9-2f6c-313a-ab0c-21fd100cbfb7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une façon appartenant à l’ordre de l’intelligence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7fd7a3a-b609-4bec-a04f-bb3e9ce1f366",
                                "sense_id": "4a1bb9bc-4187-3e66-a23b-14224bcdeffe",
                                "text": "Par la grandeur et la beauté de la créature, on pouvait voir et connaître intelligiblement le créateur."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0691c138-778e-4279-89e5-a3d8de223a07",
                                "sense_id": "4a1bb9bc-4187-3e66-a23b-14224bcdeffe",
                                "text": "Il [Platon] appelle quelquefois la matière éternelle ; par où il n'a pas voulu faire entendre qu’elle subsistait visiblement de toute éternité, mais qu’elle subsistait intelligiblement dans l’idée éternelle de Dieu ; c’est ce qu’il entend lorsqu'il dit : l’exemplaire du monde est de toute éternité."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "51bb32ac-b052-476b-a227-30a122437ce2",
                        "source_entry_id": "46a5ddf9-2f6c-313a-ab0c-21fd100cbfb7",
                        "target_lang_word": "intelligibly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "intelligibly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "368cabe2-5975-3412-877b-a550624649cf",
                                        "entry_id": "4fa415ba-feb0-3e76-908b-c26ee41ca381",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an intelligible manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2869e7f6-f7bc-4a78-a97d-13ac6f38d035",
                                                "sense_id": "368cabe2-5975-3412-877b-a550624649cf",
                                                "text": "O my God, (euer conſtant to thine ovvne vvayes), thou haſt proceeded opẽly [openly], intelligibly, manifeſtly, by the book."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a9b8dfe-6433-422a-939b-557b2ae6e0d5",
                                                "sense_id": "368cabe2-5975-3412-877b-a550624649cf",
                                                "text": "When people can no longer disagree intelligibly, a society disintegrates; where they need interpreters, they cannot either unite or emerge from conflict into unbelittling compromise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7087876-62f3-46cb-9d76-35e722a099d5",
                                                "sense_id": "368cabe2-5975-3412-877b-a550624649cf",
                                                "text": "In order to state intelligibly the working hypothesis suggested by the foregoing facts, it will be necessary to briefly state the conclusions as to the formation of åsar and the determination of river courses reached by the senior author after a practically exhaustive survey of the cenology of the north-eastern quarter of Iowa."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b1a4fcd0-0be2-455e-8e74-47f1017f2781",
                        "source_entry_id": "46a5ddf9-2f6c-313a-ab0c-21fd100cbfb7",
                        "target_lang_word": "understandably",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "understandably",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc891245-be27-3c04-a6f3-24b532f5fb20",
                                        "entry_id": "511a9d64-1df8-3c4e-a864-f4bd0dc523d4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "For reasons that are easy to understand or sympathise with."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9b9f482-7d29-42f5-97e6-cd2dbcf2fc8e",
                                                "sense_id": "dc891245-be27-3c04-a6f3-24b532f5fb20",
                                                "text": "Understandably, he was too embarrassed to speak."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4eb8329b-e3a0-4d7d-9c5b-ffabc981f932",
                                                "sense_id": "dc891245-be27-3c04-a6f3-24b532f5fb20",
                                                "text": "Embarrassed, he understandably refused to speak."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d783dc17-b7e2-48eb-bc4e-dba1f1c7efe3",
                                                "sense_id": "dc891245-be27-3c04-a6f3-24b532f5fb20",
                                                "text": "He was understandably embarrassed, and could not speak."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86f578ad-61f7-427d-b367-aac99bcc1e11",
                                                "sense_id": "dc891245-be27-3c04-a6f3-24b532f5fb20",
                                                "text": "Everton were, perhaps understandably, deflated at the setback and it was no surprise when Suarez added Liverpool's second after 82 minutes. Distin and Baines were involved in a mix-up as the Uruguayan advanced into the area, and he was not about to pass up the gift to shoot low past Howard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ead5e2a2-473a-3451-975d-743267eb83ef",
                                        "entry_id": "511a9d64-1df8-3c4e-a864-f4bd0dc523d4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an understandable manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e856a179-6eaa-4f03-a03f-7ee1ac6696c7",
                                                "sense_id": "ead5e2a2-473a-3451-975d-743267eb83ef",
                                                "text": "When presenting in front of the class, take care to speak clearly and understandably."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd805714-2288-4c68-af48-39c8b7cc366a",
                                                "sense_id": "ead5e2a2-473a-3451-975d-743267eb83ef",
                                                "text": "Accordingly, even though readers always and understandably speak of the theories adumbrated by Socrates here as \"Plato's theories\", one ought not to speak of them so without some compunction--the writing itself, and also Plato the author, present these always in a spirit of open-ended exploration, and sometimes there are contextual clues indicating that Socrates exaggerates or goes what the argument truly justifies, and so on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b04d5c4c-3eff-4ae7-94c2-e2c5c914cb3b",
                        "source_entry_id": "46a5ddf9-2f6c-313a-ab0c-21fd100cbfb7",
